    <div id="main">
      <p>This is the home page for:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong><a href="metakit.html">Metakit</a></strong> - a small and fast <strong>embedded database library</strong>.</li>
<li><strong><a href="tclkit.html">Tclkit</a></strong> - a self-contained runtime combining <strong>Tcl/Tk</strong>, Metakit, and IncrTcl.</li>
<li><strong><a href="starkit.html">Starkits</a></strong> - a simple yet effective way to <strong>deploy</strong> self-contained applications.</li>
<li><strong><a href="catfish.html">CatFish</a></strong> - a popular simple <strong>disk catalog</strong> utility for Windows.</li>
</ul>
<p>Older sections of this site can still be found in the <a href="about/older.html">Older</a> page, as well as:</p>
<ul>
<li>The <a href="moam.html">Musings</a> page and <a href="/">weblog</a> for some other writings and opinions.</li>
<li>The <strong>Vlerq</strong> project has its <a href="vlerq-org.html">own area</a>.</li>
<li>The <strong>Mavrig</strong> project also has its <a href="mavrig-org.html">own area</a>.</li>
</ul>
<p>My work on physical computing is called <strong>JeeLabs</strong> - it now has its <a href="http://jeelabs.org/">own website</a>.</p>
